# 911 Fiesta V7 - AUDIO Dependencies (BPM detection/analysis)
#
# Adds audio capture and analysis packages on top of base.in.
#
# USAGE:
#   pip-compile audio.in -o lock/audio.lock.txt --resolver=backtracking
#   pip install -r lock/audio.lock.txt
#
# NOTE: sounddevice requires libportaudio2 (apt install libportaudio2).
#       soundfile requires libsndfile1 (apt install libsndfile1).
#       aubio may require libaubio-dev or a conda install.

-r base.in

